e": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T15:00:05Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "Yep. Bought the trademark and revived it", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T15:01:19Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "When I went to Old Delhi few months back, Campa cola was the only beverage being served in all the eateries. Tastes pretty nice", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T15:02:06Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Yes, apparently it’s seen a spike in sales due to the indo us tariff drama", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T15:02:20Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Many smaller biz are avoiding coke and pepsi now because videsi", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T15:02:23Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "No. Palestine - Israel", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T15:02:40Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Oh right", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T15:03:15Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "In fact we had a coke bottle. And some of the eateries said you can’t drink here. We said it’s soft drinks.  No alcohol\nMixed", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]